":"The project navigator provides an overview over all the files and folders in your project."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"columns":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A secondary click opens a context menu with options to open a file in different places, add files and folders, set bookmarks and more.","type":"text"}]}],"size":1},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"project_navigator_context_menu","type":"image"}]}]}],"type":"row","numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"At the bottom of the project navigator is a filter textfield to filter the shown files.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The filter textfield also provides buttons for only showing recently changed files and\/or files with a source control status."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"project_navigator_filter_textfield","type":"image"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plus button next to the filter textfield is for adding files and folders to the project."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Project"},{"title":"Source Control","content":[{"anchor":"Source-Control-Navigator","text":"Source Control Navigator","type":"heading","level":3},{"style":"tip","name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌘2"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whenever a file is added, changed, moved or deleted its source-control status changes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"In the Changes tab of the source control navigator Xcodes lists all files with a source control status.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The symbols on the right indicate the type of the status.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A secondary click on one of the files opens a context menu with options to stage, unstage, discard changes and more."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the filter textfield at the bottom of the source control navigator to filter the shown files.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the Repositories tab to access the repositories of the project and all it’s meta data like branches, tags, remotes and such."}]},{"type":"row","numberOfColumns":2,"columns":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Next to the filter textfield is a button for global actions for all files with version control status like “Discard All Changes”, “Stash Changes” and more.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"source_control_global_actions"}]}],"size":1}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Bookmark-Navigator","text":"Bookmark Navigator"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌘3","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"type":"aside","style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your bookmarks are listed here.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can add file, line and search bookmarks."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"numberOfColumns":2,"columns":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Next to the bookmark is an indicator if the bookmark is checked.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"So you can use the bookmark feature as a to-do list."}]}],"size":1},{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"bookmarks_navigator"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"row"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"See also","anchor":"See-also"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/onehundredxcodetips.OneHundredXcodeTips\/documentation\/OneHundredXcodeTips\/LineBookmark","isActive":true}]}],"title":"Bookmark"},{"